rilliance, and sustainability. Every setting is handcrafted. using the finest grade recycled of solid gold or platinum.","link_title":"","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/pages\/lab-grown-diamonds"}},"40ffcd00-36bd-415b-bf58-4fe3aae4a3a5":{"type":"card","settings":{"title":"","sub_title":"GIVES BACK 10% PROFITS","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MiaDonna-The-Story-Icons_Give-Back-hi.png","card_info":"MiaDonna is a foundation-first company that gives at least 10% net profits to rebuild and repair the land and lives devastated by the diamond mining industry. We do this through our foundation, The Greener Diamond.","link_title":"Learn More","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/pages\/the-greener-diamond"}},"9b6bd637-353f-4ded-9ecd-085fa75e0bae":{"type":"card","settings":{"title":"","sub_title":"PROTECTS THE EARTH","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MiaDonna-The-Story-Icons_Protect-the-Earth-hi.png","card_info":"We save thousands of tons in natural resources by not mining for diamonds and new gold for our jewelry. We boast a short supply chain and offset carbon emissions required for the minimal shipping by planting a tree for every order.","link_title":"Learn More","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/pages\/our-pledge"}},"c882b7a6-3cda-4516-b472-f38a95b576bf":{"type":"card","settings":{"title":"","sub_title":"ADVOCATES FOR YOU","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MiaDonna-The-Story-Icons_By-Consumers-hi.png","card_info":"We love fine jewelry too! We are consumer advocates, offering luxury jewelry for attainable prices, with endless customization options, easy returns and financing options, free domestic shipping, and world class support from our jewelry experts.","link_title":"Learn More","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/pages\/reviews"}},"c2b0a61a-9de7-44c8-8737-9393178513c1":{"type":"card","settings":{"title":"","sub_title":"FEMALE FOUNDED","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/women-founded-led_085cdda5-0cf7-49b5-9694-fe8997a1098f.png","card_info":"We were founded by a mother who wanted to use the power of diamonds to repair, protect, and empower disenfranchised communities. We're proudly led by a team of strong, altruistic women.","link_title":"Learn More","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/pages\/the-founder"}},"d1f075f1-a472-4a4a-a2a6-95208d4748f3":{"type":"card","settings":{"title":"","sub_title":"B CORP CERTIFIED 83.3 PTS","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MiaDonna-The-Story-Icons_B-Corp-web.png","card_info":"As the first B Corp-certified diamond retailer, we continue to meet the highest standards of social and environmental impact. We measure more than profit, and use business as a force for good.","link_title":"","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/blogs\/news\/miadonna-becomes-the-first-b-corp-certified-lab-grown-diamond-company"}}},"block_order":["c1d13f08-65b9-43cc-a254-6248d160bb62","40ffcd00-36bd-415b-bf58-4fe3aae4a3a5","9b6bd637-353f-4ded-9ecd-085fa75e0bae","c882b7a6-3cda-4516-b472-f38a95b576bf","c2b0a61a-9de7-44c8-8737-9393178513c1","d1f075f1-a472-4a4a-a2a6-95208d4748f3"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"The MiaDonna Difference","card_per_row":3,"show_gutter":true,"background_color":"#ffffff","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":40,"css_class":"","custom_css":""}},"ffe6e242-6551-4e5d-a37d-abf980cf1a3f":{"type":"index__image-with-text","blocks":{"56f080f5-58a8-41d2-b2b1-ee74d6127251":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"OUR STORY","pre-title":"","heading_size":"small","text":"<p>MiaDonna began with a simple yet powerful idea: to re-imagine diamonds for the modern world through innovation, integrity and impact.<br\/><br\/>MiaDonna was one of the first to offer lab grown diamonds at scale as a true pioneer. <br\/><br\/>Since 2005, our commitment has been to craft pieces that celebrate beauty, honor responsible innovation, and hold meaning for generations to come.<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}},"61b82b63-0ddb-474a-b218-26dc3f8a74ed":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block_c9308ffb-328d-440a-b5ce-2483822515c8.jpg","image_link":"","image_text":""}}},"block_order":["56f080f5-58a8-41d2-b2b1-ee74d6127251","61b82b63-0ddb-474a-b218-26dc3f8a74ed"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"width":"wide","show_gutter":true,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":80,"animation":"none","id_sec":"","css_class":"section-one-half","custom_css":""}},"f8bea500-5c0d-4262-a369-703910dfb1d4":{"type":"index__image-with-text","blocks":{"template--15035832991823__f8bea500-5c0d-4262-a369-703910dfb1d4-image-1":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block2.jpg","image_link":"","image_text":""}},"template--15035832991823__f8bea500-5c0d-4262-a369-703910dfb1d4-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"OUR MISSION","pre-title":"","heading_size":"small","text":"<p>To celebrate life\u2019s most meaningful moments with beautifully crafted lab-grown diamond jewelry.<br\/><br\/>\u2028We blend modern elegance with responsible innovation to make luxury more accessible \u2014 offering timeless pieces that honor your story today, and for years to come.<br\/><br\/><br\/><\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}}},"block_order":["template--15035832991823__f8bea500-5c0d-4262-a369-703910dfb1d4-image-1","template--15035832991823__f8bea500-5c0d-4262-a369-703910dfb1d4-text-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"width":"wide","show_gutter":true,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":20,"animation":"none","id_sec":"","css_class":"section-one-half more-space","custom_css":""}},"32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe51":{"type":"index__image-with-text","blocks":{"template--15035832991823__32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe51-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"ETHICAL JEWELRY","pre-title":"","heading_size":"small","text":"<p>Brilliance without compromise.<br\/><br\/>Every diamond we offer is lab-grown, a beautiful, modern alternative crafted with integrity and care. Our metals are primarily recycled, and our practices reflect a commitment to quality and conscience. It\u2019s jewelry you can feel confident wearing, made to reflect both your values and your style.<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}},"template--15035832991823__32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe51-image-1":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block3.jpg","image_link":"","image_text":""}}},"block_order":["template--15035832991823__32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe51-text-1","template--15035832991823__32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe51-image-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"width":"wide","show_gutter":true,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":20,"animation":"none","id_sec":"","css_class":"section-one-half more-space","custom_css":""}},"index_image_with_text_qf6rc8":{"type":"index__image-with-text","blocks":{"image_Pmyr33":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block4.jpg","image_link":"","image_text":""}},"text_7G7DFn":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"OUR PROMISE TO YOU","pre-title":"","heading_size":"small","text":"<p>Exceptional quality, intentional design, and a personalized experience.<br\/><br\/>From the first glance to the final polish, our pieces are made to last, thoughtfully crafted with high-quality materials, refined settings, and timeless appeal.<br\/><br\/>We\u2019re here to help you celebrate what matters most, with jewelry that feels as special as the moments you wear it for.<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}}},"block_order":["image_Pmyr33","text_7G7DFn"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"width":"wide","show_gutter":true,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":50,"animation":"none","id_sec":"","css_class":"section-one-half more-space","custom_css":""}},"index_image_with_text_2_Qg4qPX":{"type":"index__image-with-text-2","blocks":{"text_YmTDtM":{"type":"text","settings":{"heading_tag":"h1","title":"OUR STORY","title2":"","text":"<p>MiaDonna began with a simple yet powerful idea: to re-imagine diamonds for the modern world through innovation, integrity and impact.<br\/><br\/>MiaDonna was one of the first to offer lab grown diamonds at scale as a true pioneer. <br\/><br\/>Since 2005, our commitment has been to craft pieces that celebrate beauty, honor responsible innovation, and hold meaning for generations to come.<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","open_new_new_tab_button_1_ink":false,"button_label2":"","link2":"","button_style2":"button--primary","open_new_new_tab_button__2_link":false,"background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}},"image_dbnJ3y":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block_c9308ffb-328d-440a-b5ce-2483822515c8.jpg","image_link":"","iframe_video":""}}},"block_order":["text_YmTDtM","image_dbnJ3y"],"name":"Index image with text 2","settings":{"width":"wide","text_style":false,"sectionid":"section1","show_gutter":false,"padding_top":15,"padding_bottom":20,"animation":"none","arialabelledby":"our-story-heading","id_sec":"","css_class":"image-text-nw mob-textup mmt-20","custom_css":""}},"index_image_with_text_2_9ayPet":{"type":"index__image-with-text-2","blocks":{"image_WPBbN4":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block2.jpg","image_link":"","iframe_video":""}},"text_REWDzj":{"type":"text","settings":{"heading_tag":"h2","title":"OUR MISSION","title2":"","text":"<p>To celebrate life\u2019s most meaningful moments with beautifully crafted lab-grown diamond jewelry.<br\/><br\/>\u2028We blend modern elegance with responsible innovation to make luxury more accessible \u2014 offering timeless pieces that honor your story today, and for years to come.<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","open_new_new_tab_button_1_ink":false,"button_label2":"","link2":"","button_style2":"button--primary","open_new_new_tab_button__2_link":false,"background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}}},"block_order":["image_WPBbN4","text_REWDzj"],"name":"Index image with text 2","settings":{"width":"wide","text_style":false,"sectionid":"section2","show_gutter":false,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":20,"animation":"none","arialabelledby":"our-mission-heading","id_sec":"","css_class":"image-text-nw mob-textup","custom_css":""}},"index_image_with_text_2_A7GPkq":{"type":"index__image-with-text-2","blocks":{"text_HhBGQr":{"type":"text","settings":{"heading_tag":"h2","title":"ETHICAL JEWELRY","title2":"","text":"<p>Brilliance without compromise.<br\/><br\/>Every diamond we offer is lab-grown, a beautiful, modern alternative crafted with integrity and care. Our metals are primarily recycled, and our practices reflect a commitment to quality and conscience. It\u2019s jewelry you can feel confident wearing, made to reflect both your values and your style.<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","open_new_new_tab_button_1_ink":false,"button_label2":"","link2":"","button_style2":"button--primary","open_new_new_tab_button__2_link":false,"background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}},"image_mB7EXf":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block3.jpg","image_link":"","iframe_video":""}}},"block_order":["text_HhBGQr","image_mB7EXf"],"name":"Index image with text 2","settings":{"width":"wide","text_style":false,"sectionid":"section3","show_gutter":false,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":20,"animation":"none","arialabelledby":"ethical-jewelry-heading","id_sec":"","css_class":"image-text-nw mob-textup","custom_css":""}},"index_image_with_text_2_MawLYT":{"type":"index__image-with-text-2","blocks":{"image_nxWj8P":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block4.jpg","image_link":"","iframe_video":""}},"text_7f4g6B":{"type":"text","settings":{"heading_tag":"h2","title":"OUR PROMISE TO YOU","title2":"","text":"<p>Exceptional quality, intentional design, and a personalized experience.<br\/><br\/>From the first glance to the final polish, our pieces are made to last, thoughtfully crafted with high-quality materials, refined settings, and timeless appeal.<br\/><br\/>We\u2019re here to help you celebrate what matters most, with jewelry that feels as special as the moments you wear it for.<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","open_new_new_tab_button_1_ink":false,"button_label2":"","link2":"","button_style2":"button--primary","open_new_new_tab_button__2_link":false,"background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}}},"block_order":["image_nxWj8P","text_7f4g6B"],"name":"Index image with text 2","settings":{"width":"wide","text_style":false,"sectionid":"section4","show_gutter":false,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":50,"animation":"none","arialabelledby":"our-promise-heading","id_sec":"","css_class":"image-text-nw mob-textup","custom_css":""}},"home_category_slider_jFU6gH":{"type":"home-category-slider","blocks":{"category_ncVJXm":{"type":"category","settings":{"collection":"lab-grown-diamond-engagement-rings","title":"Engagement Ring","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block_b6367e8b-0314-402d-935b-e18db8694fa8.jpg"}},"category_PTHDEF":{"type":"category","settings":{"collection":"shop-all-wedding","title":"Wedding Bands","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block-1.jpg"}},"category_g4kQ8V":{"type":"category","settings":{"collection":"lab-grown-diamond-necklaces","title":"Necklaces","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block-2.jpg"}},"category_GknKF7":{"type":"category","settings":{"collection":"lab-grown-diamond-earrings","title":"Earrings","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block-3.jpg"}},"category_84WVLm":{"type":"category","settings":{"collection":"lab-grown-diamond-bracelets","title":"Bracelets","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Shop_Lab_Grown_Diamond_Bracelets.png"}}},"block_order":["category_ncVJXm","category_PTHDEF","category_g4kQ8V","category_GknKF7","category_84WVLm"],"custom_css":[],"name":"Home Category Slider","settings":{"class":"common-spacing text-center","title":"SHOP COLLECTIONS","content":""}},"home_accordion_faq_fjNYG7":{"type":"home-accordion-faq","blocks":{"accordion_item_EdmxPE":{"type":"accordion_item","settings":{"title":"Why Choose a Lab-Grown Engagement Ring?","content":"Lab-grown diamonds offer the same beauty and brilliance as mined diamonds without the environmental cost. At MiaDonna, we create engagement rings using premium lab-created diamonds, designed with intention and built to last. Each piece reflects a modern approach to fine jewelry: elegant, meaningful, and made to celebrate life\u2019s most important moments."}},"accordion_item_zDUNaU":{"type":"accordion_item","settings":{"title":"Can I Design My Own Engagement Ring?","content":"Absolutely. At MiaDonna, you can design a custom engagement ring that reflects your personal style and story. Start by choosing your favorite setting, metal, and lab-grown diamond or gemstone. From there, our team will help bring your vision to life making the process effortless, inspiring, and entirely your own. Whether you're designing solo or with a partner, you\u2019ll end up with something truly one-of-a-kind."}},"accordion_item_wLzPcB":{"type":"accordion_item","settings":{"title":"Are Lab-Grown Diamonds Real?","content":"Yes, lab-grown diamonds are 100% real. MiaDonna\u2019s lab-created diamonds are made of pure carbon, just like mined diamonds. They have the same optical, physical, and chemical properties, offering the same brilliance, hardness, and sparkle.\n\nThink of it like ice from a glacier versus ice from your freezer - different origins, same result. With lab-grown diamonds, you get all the beauty of a traditional diamond, crafted through modern innovation."}},"accordion_item_hkAwj3":{"type":"accordion_item","settings":{"title":"Does MiaDonna Offer a Guarantee?","content":"Yes. Every MiaDonna piece comes with a Lifetime Guarantee that reflects our commitment to quality and craftsmanship. We guarantee that all jewelry is free from manufacturing defects in materials and workmanship at the time of delivery. And because our lab-grown diamonds are real diamonds, their brilliance, clarity, and structure will never fade or cloud over time.\nIt's our promise that your ring will shine as beautifully in the years ahead as it does the day it arrives."}}},"block_order":["accordion_item_EdmxPE","accordion_item_zDUNaU","accordion_item_wLzPcB","accordion_item_hkAwj3"],"name":"Home Accordion FAQ","settings":{"background_color":"#f8f8f8","sectionid":"","section_heading":"Explore the finest<br>lab-grown diamonds","columns":2}},"e0422252-b178-4354-aaae-d4a69aa9b4f3":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"{% render 'request-quote-popup' %}"}},"5fb0f164-ba84-4c8f-aafc-9582d8ca0103":{"type":"collection-block","blocks":{"40c78440-4092-4072-bb64-fcb27b329b94":{"type":"collection_block","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/millie-engagement-ring-pl_2_400x_a1db46c5-363d-4a3a-ae94-1a2a03f4a497.webp","image_alt":"","title":"Engagement Rings","url":"\/collections\/halo-engagement-rings"}},"fad8f26d-cadf-4669-8f13-e47715ebac24":{"type":"collection_block","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/wedding-bands_400x_91dc1f6e-d934-4c4d-93f6-56f3203415aa.webp","image_alt":"","title":"Wedding Bands","url":"\/collections\/weddi